# Environment variables for local development.
#
# Every variable the code reads is listed in this file with a comment. The feature that
# introduces a variable adds it here. To use them, copy the lines you need to `.env.local`
# in the workspace that reads them (for example apps/web/.env.local). `.env*` files other
# than this one are gitignored.
#
# Rules:
# - Variables prefixed with VITE_ (web) or EXPO_PUBLIC_ (mobile) are bundled into the app and
#   are therefore public. Never put a secret in them.
# - Secrets are never stored in .env files of this repository. AWS secrets live in SSM
#   Parameter Store (ADR-0003); CI authenticates to AWS with OIDC, without keys (ADR-0012).
#
# No variables are used yet.
